Predict negative responses to test-result labels, Python dependency paths,
source-tree spellings, and selected logging/API expressions. fmt.Printf
instead receives a positive response. The response sizes summarize training
examples. These are distinct lexical sensitivities, not one shared meaning:
most background and rarer expressions remain unmodeled. Keep only the last
100 characters within the current document; predict zero outside the rules.
